# Docker build context tune-down for nginx/.
#
# NOTE: nginx runs from the stock `nginx:1.27-alpine` image; nginx.conf and
# TLS certs are mounted at runtime (bind mount / K8s Secret), never COPY'd.
# This file mostly protects the locally generated self-signed TLS private key
# from ever leaking into an image or CI build context.

# --- TLS secrets (local dev certs) ---
certs/

# --- VCS / IDE ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# --- Local / OS ---
*.log
logs/
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Reports / analysis (not needed in image) ---
HELP.md
implementation.txt
IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT.md